OL,3,AMI5 chief warns against overstating
OL,4,ARussian interference in Brexit vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FMI5 chief Sir Ken McCallum has said
OL,7,Fthere was Russian interference in the
OL,8,Fthe Brexit referendum, but warned
OL,9,Fagainst overstating its impact on the
OL,10,Fresult.
OL,12,FIt comes after Prime Minister Andy
OL,13,FBurnham provoked a backlash from some
OL,14,FBrexit campaigners by saying it was
OL,15,F"clear" there had been interference by
OL,16,FMoscow in the 2016 vote.
OL,18,FSir Ken said it was "a matter of public
OL,19,Frecord" that there was interference in
OL,20,Fthe referendum by online trolls and
OL,21,Fbots.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
