OL,3,AMissiles intercepted near Riyadh after
OL,4,ASaudi coalition hits Yemen fuel depot
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Houthis warned they would target
OL,7,Fthe airport and Aramco refinery in
OL,8,FSaudi Arabia's capital, Riyadh, and
OL,9,FAramco's headquarters in the eastern
OL,10,Fcity of Dammam.
OL,12,FAl-Maliki later said missiles targeting
OL,13,Fcities including Dammam had been
OL,14,Fintercepted, while shrapnel had fallen
OL,15,Fin a residential area in Dhahran.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
