OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACornell bans all fraternity parties
OL,4,Aover gang sex assault allegations
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement on Tuesday, Cornell's
OL,7,Fpresident, Michael Kotlikoff, announced
OL,8,Fa series of measures responding to the
OL,9,Falleged assault, including the end to
OL,10,Ffraternity parties for the rest of the
OL,11,Fschool year.
OL,13,F"I am deeply sorry for the harm Jane
OL,14,FDoe suffered in 2024, and appalled that
OL,15,Fthis act of sexual violence occurred
OL,16,Fwithin our Cornell community," he said.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
